    "detailed_description": "'Boo!' is a spooky puzzle game for you! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy spooky puzzler for the first time in its full form on Steam!<br />\r\nTo solve the puzzles in &quot;Boo!&quot; you have to dip the pumpkin in the different paints and wear attributes to mask certain parts of the pumpkin.<br />\r\nThe puzzles start easy but it gets more difficult!<br />\r\nCan you make the correct pumpkin in 42 Halloween themed levels?<br />\r\nComplete all the levels to unlock the daily puzzle mode!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHappy Halloween,<br />\r\nBart Bonte",
